subckt astra_001_rc_coupled_bjt_amplifier (vcc VSS in out)
C1 (b1 in) capacitor c=1u
C2 (e1 VSS) capacitor c=100u
C3 (b2 c1) capacitor c=1u
C4 (out c2) capacitor c=10u
C5 (out VSS) capacitor c=100p
Q1 (c1 b1 e1) ANPN
Q2 (c2 b2 e2) ANPN
R1 (vcc b1) resistor r=100k
R2 (b1 VSS) resistor r=22k
R3 (vcc c1) resistor r=4.7k
R4 (e1 VSS) resistor r=1k
R5 (vcc b2) resistor r=100k
R6 (b2 VSS) resistor r=22k
R7 (vcc c2) resistor r=4.7k
R8 (e2 VSS) resistor r=1k
R9 (out VSS) resistor r=10k
